VictoryRoad_1F_Text_NaomiIntro::
    .string "I wonder if you are good enough\n"
    .string "for me?$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_NaomiDefeat::
    .string "I lost out…$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_NaomiPostBattle::
    .string "I never wanted to lose to anybody,\n"
    .string "especially to a younger kid…$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_RolandoIntro::
    .string "I can see you're good.\n"
    .string "Let me see exactly how good!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_RolandoDefeat::
    .string "I had a chance…$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_RolandoPostBattle::
    .string "Tch!\n"
    .string "I concede, you are better than I!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_SamIntro::
    .string "These aren't your average bug-\n"
	.string "types!\p"
    .string "Let's duel!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_SamDefeat::
    .string "MY BUGS!!!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_SamPostBattle::
    .string "I know they aren't all bugs,\p"
    .string "I just like the net.$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_KatieIntro::
    .string "I've always loved RAICHU!\p"
    .string "Let me show you how great\n"
	.string "they are!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_KatieDefeat::
    .string "Aw, RAICHU and their\n"
	.string "friends lost...$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_KatiePostBattle::
    .string "It doesn't matter,\n"
    .string "RAICHU is still the best to me!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_JustinIntro::
    .string "LOOT AND PILLAGE!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_JustinDefeat::
    .string "I thought you were soft\n"
	.string "and weak...$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_JustinPostBattle::
    .string "Go away, I am looking for my\n"
	.string "next victim!\p"
    .string "A burglar's life for me,\n"
	.string "yo-ho!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_ThomasIntro::
    .string "Everybody was Kung Fu fighting,\n"
	.string "HUH!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_ThomasDefeat::
    .string "You were fast as lightning!$"

VictoryRoad_1F_Text_ThomasPostBattle::
    .string "Oh-ho-ho-ho,\p"
	.string "HA!$"
